# Rush Linux Contributors

This file recognizes everyone who has contributed to Rush Linux. Contributions
include code, documentation, testing, design, bug reports, community support,
and more.

## Maintainer

- **@Nan0pk** — project founder, architecture, `optid`, `optctl`, build system,
  documentation, kernel config, packaging, CI

## Contributors

*(This list will grow as the project welcomes new contributors. If you've
contributed and your name is missing, please open a PR to add yourself.)*

